WEBVTT

00:05.730 --> 00:11.240
<b>Class Stall

- Octopus balls (3)
- Okonomiyaki (3)
- Café (8)
- Manga café (10)
- Crêpes (5)
- Ramen (5)</b>

00:06.990 --> 00:11.240
<b><i>It was decided that our class 
would host a manga café.</i></b>

00:11.510 --> 00:16.240
<b><i>Now we committee members were 
staying behind to discuss</i></b>

00:16.240 --> 00:20.750
<b>Gym Stage

- Chorus (7)
- Dance (3)
- Play (12)
- Karaoke (5)
- Fashion Show (7)</b>

00:16.240 --> 00:20.750
<b><i>the play we'd perform on the 
special stage in the gym.</i></b>

00:21.540 --> 00:25.700
<b>Let's come up with some 
ideas for our play here</b>

00:25.700 --> 00:28.880
<b>and have the class pick one in homeroom.</b>

00:29.140 --> 00:30.130
<b>Okay.</b>

00:30.400 --> 00:34.130
<b>Yeah, but where do we even start?</b>

00:34.380 --> 00:36.390
<b>We gotta do <i>Momotaro</i>!</b>

00:36.390 --> 00:38.360
<b>What are you, a kindergartener?</b>

00:38.360 --> 00:40.140
<b>Aw, why not?</b>

00:40.420 --> 00:43.840
<b>Hmm... What about <i>Romeo and Juliet</i>?</b>

00:43.840 --> 00:45.480
<b>Whoof, what a cliché.</b>

00:45.750 --> 00:47.520
<b>Some kind of romantic drama, maybe!</b>

00:47.520 --> 00:49.610
<b>Like <i>The Phantom of the Opera</i>.</b>

00:52.400 --> 00:57.550
<b>Just show the absolute greatest enthusiasm 
you can muster on any and all fronts.</b>

00:53.860 --> 00:58.200
<b>Show maximum enthusiasm on all fronts</b>

01:00.190 --> 01:03.950
<b>H-Hey, why don't we use this 
chance to do an original play?</b>

01:05.470 --> 01:06.800
<b>Original?</b>

02:38.010 --> 02:42.760
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 7
Important items are usually 
lying around in enchanted forests</b>

02:41.960 --> 02:48.120
<b>Then it's official: our class will 
be putting on an original play!</b>

02:42.760 --> 02:50.770
<b>Plays

- Romeo & Juliet (9)
- Romantic Drama (8)
- Phantom of the Opera (4)
- Momotaro (1)
- Original (12)</b>

02:48.120 --> 02:50.770
<b>And here's your director: Tomozaki!</b>

02:48.980 --> 02:50.770
<b>Director!</b>

02:51.040 --> 02:53.290
<b>Remember, this is <i>your</i> bright idea.</b>

02:53.290 --> 02:54.980
<b>Go get 'em, Army Boy!</b>

02:55.270 --> 02:56.770
<b>We're counting on you, Fumiya.</b>

02:56.770 --> 02:58.380
<b>You've got this!</b>

02:58.380 --> 03:01.240
<b><i>Well, my opinion definitely did get across...</i></b>

03:01.530 --> 03:04.120
<b>Thanks in advance, Director Brain!</b>

03:04.330 --> 03:05.800
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

03:05.800 --> 03:08.200
<b><i>So while I think about this play...</i></b>

03:08.760 --> 03:09.990
<b>First, there's Yuzu.</b>

03:10.540 --> 03:13.040
<b>Then Mimimi and Hanabi,</b>

03:13.040 --> 03:14.670
<b>and finally Fuka.</b>

03:15.240 --> 03:17.790
<b>Who would you most want to date?</b>

03:19.300 --> 03:21.870
<b><i>Can I even do this?</i></b>

03:29.310 --> 03:32.770
<b>Man, what an exhausting day.</b>

03:32.770 --> 03:34.980
<b>All those meetings didn't help.</b>

03:34.980 --> 03:36.980
<b>And, hey, Yuzu!</b>

03:36.980 --> 03:39.240
<b>You're going to be the promem leader!</b>

03:39.450 --> 03:40.730
<b>Promem?</b>

03:40.730 --> 03:43.320
<b>Hey, Army Boy—what's "promem"?</b>

03:43.320 --> 03:44.740
<b>It's an abbreviation.</b>

03:45.280 --> 03:47.580
<b>It stands for a culture 
festival project member:</b>

03:48.150 --> 03:50.800
<b>someone on the class committee</b>

03:50.800 --> 03:53.080
<b>who <i>also</i> helps runs the 
festival at the school level.</b>

03:53.330 --> 03:57.710
<b>Izumi volunteered and got 
named leader, remember?</b>

03:57.710 --> 04:00.610
<b>Oh, right... You were asleep.</b>

04:01.090 --> 04:03.400
<b>Oh, okay, yeah!</b>

04:03.400 --> 04:05.970
<b>It's crazy that you can sleep like that.</b>

04:06.240 --> 04:10.140
<b>Even during the sports tournament, 
Yuzu would step in as captain.</b>

04:10.140 --> 04:14.350
<b>She's just been brimming with energy lately!</b>

04:14.350 --> 04:18.110
<b>Yeah, I thought I'd try 
spreading my wings a little.</b>

04:18.320 --> 04:20.230
<b>Just don't overdo it.</b>

04:20.820 --> 04:22.900
<b>Thanks, Shuji.</b>

04:23.220 --> 04:24.550
<b>Aw. Sweet.</b>

04:24.550 --> 04:25.660
<b>Shut it.</b>

04:27.910 --> 04:29.010
<b>See ya!</b>

04:32.140 --> 04:33.660
<b>Later!</b>

04:36.690 --> 04:39.420
<b><i>What can I knock off my Pinsta list?</i></b>

04:39.420 --> 04:42.800
<b>Minami Nanami eating ramen</b>

04:39.710 --> 04:42.190
<b><i>Mimimi eating ramen... Hmm.</i></b>

04:42.800 --> 04:44.060
<b>Bye!</b>

04:45.110 --> 04:50.430
<b><i>Mimimi and ramen... Could be 
tough to get the pieces in place.</i></b>

04:51.180 --> 04:56.300
<b><i>It's in these little details where 
Hinami's sadism really shines.</i></b>

04:57.060 --> 04:59.390
<b>I'm so psyched for the play!</b>

04:59.390 --> 05:01.540
<b>How about one about basketball?</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:06.070
<b>Maybe where the star racks up fouls right 
after the game starts and gets ejected!</b>

05:06.070 --> 05:08.070
<b>Gee, sounds familiar.</b>

05:08.350 --> 05:10.080
<b>Good one!</b>

05:10.560 --> 05:14.080
<b>I had a hard time letting 
go of the comedy-act option.</b>

05:14.320 --> 05:18.080
<b>With your quick comebacks, 
we'd get <i>all</i> the laughs!</b>

05:18.510 --> 05:22.930
<b>Please, spare me. I'm not 
cut out for the stage.</b>

05:24.330 --> 05:28.720
<b>I guess as a brain and all, you <i>are</i>
 better suited for brain stuff!</b>

05:29.010 --> 05:33.970
<b>So my nickname means I ought to stick 
to the thinking part of things?</b>

05:33.970 --> 05:36.230
<b>That's right! You're quick!</b>

05:36.590 --> 05:38.480
<b>Well, I'm used to it by now.</b>

05:38.910 --> 05:42.430
<b>I guess we just really get each other...</b>

05:42.430 --> 05:43.480
<b>wouldn't you say?</b>

05:43.480 --> 05:44.400
<b>Whoa!</b>

05:44.720 --> 05:48.660
<b>Oho! You're built surprisingly solid, Brain!</b>

05:48.660 --> 05:51.150
<b>No, you're just really light—</b>

06:02.510 --> 06:06.380
<b>O-Oh, wow! That's quite 
the compliment, you know!</b>

06:07.680 --> 06:09.890
<b>Uh... Looks like the light's green!</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:12.500
<b>'Kay, Tomozaki, let's head home!</b>

06:12.500 --> 06:14.140
<b>Right...</b>

06:17.380 --> 06:19.040
<b>M-Mimimi?</b>

06:22.990 --> 06:24.630
<b>Wh-What is it?</b>

06:25.610 --> 06:27.490
<b>Um, well...</b>

06:30.480 --> 06:34.030
<b>Ah, to be bringing such 
a young high-school girl</b>

06:34.030 --> 06:36.910
<b>to a place like this!</b>

06:36.910 --> 06:39.210
<b>I-I was just hungry! And—</b>

06:39.210 --> 06:42.540
<b>I mean, so am I. I'm cool with it!</b>

06:42.540 --> 06:45.550
<b><i>Maybe I was a little forceful 
in how I made it happen...</i></b>

06:45.550 --> 06:47.130
<b>Minami Nanami eating ramen</b>

06:47.440 --> 06:51.660
<b><i>...but at least now I'll be able to get 
that photo of Mimimi eating ramen.</i></b>

06:52.770 --> 06:55.920
<b>Okay—I'm having the gyoza combo!</b>

06:55.920 --> 06:57.180
<b>Huh? Gyoza?!</b>

06:57.440 --> 06:59.310
<b>What about you?</b>

06:59.310 --> 07:01.100
<b>Um, well...</b>

07:01.320 --> 07:03.310
<b>Ramen... I guess?</b>

07:03.310 --> 07:04.360
<b>Okay!</b>

07:05.700 --> 07:09.780
<b><i>I just assumed that Mimimi 
would order ramen...</i></b>

07:10.610 --> 07:13.780
<b><i>but this </i>is<i> a gyoza chain.</i></b>

07:10.610 --> 07:14.370
<b>Manchuria Gyoza</b>

07:14.600 --> 07:17.870
<b>This is a pretty rare event, eh, Tomozaki?</b>

07:18.110 --> 07:22.880
<b>I-I guess so. In fact, this 
might be the first time</b>

07:23.180 --> 07:25.810
<b>I've invited anyone to a meal after school.</b>

07:25.810 --> 07:27.250
<b>Wha—?</b>

07:27.800 --> 07:31.220
<b>Then what gave you the idea to invite me?</b>

07:31.220 --> 07:34.720
<b>What gave me... the idea?</b>

07:34.720 --> 07:36.970
<b>W-Well, you know... the ramen...</b>

07:37.230 --> 07:38.720
<b>The ramen?</b>

07:38.960 --> 07:43.060
<b>Y-Yeah! I was really, <i>really</i> 
craving some ramen—</b>

07:43.060 --> 07:45.320
<b>That bad, huh?</b>

07:45.320 --> 07:46.750
<b>You want two?</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:49.030
<b>I couldn't...</b>

07:49.030 --> 07:55.820
<b><i>And with the normie superpower "conversation 
autofeed," my alibi was complete.</i></b>

07:55.820 --> 07:59.540
<b><i>Thank goodness. If I'd 
answered her honestly...</i></b>

08:00.150 --> 08:05.630
<b>I wanted to have pictures on 
my phone of you eating ramen!</b>

08:06.450 --> 08:07.350
<b>Say what?</b>

08:09.030 --> 08:10.850
<b><i>I can just picture it.</i></b>

08:12.520 --> 08:13.630
<b>Here you go!</b>

08:15.840 --> 08:17.510
<b>Let's dig in!</b>

08:17.770 --> 08:19.390
<b>Yeah, let's...</b>

08:21.390 --> 08:23.290
<b>Mmm, yum!</b>

08:23.290 --> 08:24.910
<b><i>Now what?</i></b>

08:24.910 --> 08:28.150
<b><i>How do I get a picture 
of Mimimi eating ramen?</i></b>

08:29.320 --> 08:31.820
<b>Why are you looking at 
me like that, Tomozaki?</b>

08:32.060 --> 08:35.200
<b>Oh... sorry. I was just...</b>

08:35.410 --> 08:38.730
<b>Did... Did you want a bite of ramen?</b>

08:39.410 --> 08:40.340
<b>Huh?</b>

08:41.050 --> 08:43.810
<b>Um... one bite?</b>

08:43.810 --> 08:46.330
<b>Y-Yeah... One bite...</b>

08:49.620 --> 08:51.340
<b>Wh-What's wrong?</b>

08:52.010 --> 08:53.970
<b>Am I thinking too hard?</b>

08:55.010 --> 08:56.840
<b>A-About what?</b>

08:59.620 --> 09:01.840
<b>Oh, nothing.</b>

09:02.430 --> 09:04.730
<b>Okay, lay it on me!</b>

09:08.820 --> 09:11.280
<b>Whoa! What's with the photo shoot?</b>

09:11.280 --> 09:13.410
<b>I-I-I messed up!</b>

09:13.410 --> 09:15.150
<b>Messed up what?</b>

09:15.150 --> 09:19.780
<b>I-I thought, uh... I thought 
you were going to eat my egg...</b>

09:19.780 --> 09:21.030
<b>I would never!</b>

09:21.030 --> 09:22.950
<b>But why all the photos?</b>

09:23.440 --> 09:25.540
<b>For, um... for evidence!</b>

09:25.790 --> 09:28.590
<b>Jeez, you're obsessed with this egg!</b>

09:28.590 --> 09:31.380
<b>I-I just really like them, that's all!</b>

09:31.380 --> 09:33.010
<b>Honestly...</b>

09:33.370 --> 09:35.010
<b>Here you go. Thanks!</b>

09:35.320 --> 09:37.010
<b>S-Sure.</b>

09:38.610 --> 09:41.390
<b>Hmm. Something's not quite right.</b>

09:41.620 --> 09:43.270
<b>Like what?</b>

09:46.470 --> 09:47.770
<b>Hey, Tomozaki!</b>

09:49.550 --> 09:52.230
<b>Have some of mine. Here!</b>

09:53.860 --> 09:56.360
<b><i>Oh, no, no, no, no, no!</i></b>

09:57.650 --> 09:59.330
<b><i>What's she trying to do?</i></b>

09:59.330 --> 10:04.370
<b><i>This is that, you know, that <i>thing</i>,
 that "say aah" thing—</i></b>

10:06.260 --> 10:10.830
<b><i>What's her angle? What battle is she fighting?
 Why all this pressure?!</i></b>

10:10.830 --> 10:13.280
<b><i>I-I don't even know how to turn her down...</i></b>

10:14.960 --> 10:16.830
<b><i>F-Fine!</i></b>

10:25.210 --> 10:27.390
<b><i>I didn't even get to enjoy it.</i></b>

10:29.200 --> 10:30.950
<b>Something's fishy, all right.</b>

10:30.950 --> 10:31.650
<b>Huh?</b>

10:37.300 --> 10:41.320
<b><i>What the—did I make her mad?
 What did I do?</i></b>

10:41.620 --> 10:43.290
<b><i>I-I have no idea...</i></b>

10:43.290 --> 10:45.250
<b><i>But it'd be weird to apologize.</i></b>

10:45.250 --> 10:47.730
<b><i>I don't even know what 
I'd be apologizing for.</i></b>

10:49.330 --> 10:51.830
<b><i>Damn, she's going to finish first!</i></b>

10:52.270 --> 10:55.460
<b><i>What will it do to the mood 
if I make her wait for me?</i></b>

10:55.660 --> 10:57.460
<b><i>I've got to eat fast, too!</i></b>

11:02.640 --> 11:05.960
<b>Wh-Whoa, Tomozaki! What's the rush?</b>

11:06.970 --> 11:09.020
<b>I-It's just that...</b>

11:10.400 --> 11:13.450
<b>You were going to... finish 
your gyoza first...</b>

11:13.450 --> 11:15.100
<b>I didn't want to make you wait...</b>

11:16.370 --> 11:18.670
<b>You're one odd duck, Tomozaki!</b>

11:19.930 --> 11:21.730
<b>Okay, see you later!</b>

11:21.730 --> 11:22.950
<b>Yep—later!</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:40.470
<b>Can you only take blurry pictures or what?</b>

11:41.300 --> 11:43.840
<b>You've got me there, Miss Hinami.</b>

11:44.470 --> 11:46.850
<b>Make sure you're thinking about 
who you want to date.</b>

11:49.980 --> 11:53.980
<b>Fuka Kikuchi
I'll bring that novel tomorrow.
Close / Show</b>

11:53.980 --> 11:55.980
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

11:59.460 --> 12:01.320
<b>S-Sorry for the wait.</b>

12:01.320 --> 12:02.740
<b>I-It's no problem!</b>

12:03.060 --> 12:04.790
<b>Um... here.</b>

12:05.450 --> 12:08.450
<b>Thanks. I'll let you know what I think.</b>

12:08.800 --> 12:11.000
<b>Th-This is a first for me!</b>

12:13.120 --> 12:19.590
<b>I-I've never shown anyone my work 
before, so please—go easy on me.</b>

12:20.080 --> 12:23.440
<b>Y-Yes, of course. Thank you.</b>

12:23.440 --> 12:24.920
<b>Thank <i>you</i>.</b>

12:27.200 --> 12:28.470
<b>One, two, three...</b>

12:28.470 --> 12:29.600
<b>Shoot!</b>

12:30.690 --> 12:34.850
<b>I lost again? That's four times in a row!</b>

12:37.280 --> 12:39.360
<b>Up to the foot of the hill, now.</b>

12:39.360 --> 12:40.610
<b>Sorry!</b>

12:41.110 --> 12:42.380
<b>Thanks!</b>

12:43.580 --> 12:44.860
<b>Man, four in a row...</b>

12:45.160 --> 12:46.880
<b>What are the odds?</b>

12:46.880 --> 12:48.870
<b>You suck at rock-paper-scissors, Takei.</b>

12:49.540 --> 12:51.110
<b>Shake it off!</b>

12:51.110 --> 12:52.620
<b>Damn it!</b>

12:52.620 --> 12:54.870
<b>I'll win next time—you'll see!</b>

12:54.870 --> 12:58.000
<b>Ooh, a race! I've got this in the bag!</b>

12:58.000 --> 12:59.470
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

12:59.470 --> 13:00.960
<b>Huh? We're running now?!</b>

13:07.150 --> 13:08.910
<b>Everyone's so full of energy.</b>

13:08.910 --> 13:09.760
<b>Okay—</b>

13:10.120 --> 13:11.210
<b>here I go!</b>

13:14.480 --> 13:16.520
<b><i>That look just now...</i></b>

13:17.410 --> 13:22.430
<b><i>That meant, "Here's your chance. Check 
off another one while you can."</i></b>

13:21.480 --> 13:23.240
<b>Hanabi Hirabayashi making a face</b>

13:27.620 --> 13:28.750
<b>Hey, Tama...</b>

13:30.230 --> 13:31.520
<b>Hmm? What's up?</b>

13:31.520 --> 13:34.250
<b>Can I ask you a favor?</b>

13:34.500 --> 13:37.480
<b><i>Tama's always so straightforward—</i></b>

13:37.480 --> 13:39.750
<b><i>best to just put it all right out there.</i></b>

13:40.160 --> 13:42.500
<b>I just started a Pinsta account,</b>

13:42.970 --> 13:46.260
<b>and I'd like to put a picture 
of you making a face on there.</b>

13:46.260 --> 13:47.730
<b>Would you mind?</b>

13:47.730 --> 13:49.200
<b>Well, this is sudden.</b>

13:49.200 --> 13:52.510
<b>I thought it might be a fun, 
different thing to post.</b>

13:52.760 --> 13:56.520
<b>Hmm... sure, I guess. Here!</b>

13:56.520 --> 13:59.770
<b>Wow, th-that was quick...</b>

14:00.060 --> 14:02.150
<b>Take the picture already!</b>

14:02.150 --> 14:04.140
<b>O-Oh, right!</b>

14:05.580 --> 14:07.530
<b>Okay, now one with you.</b>

14:07.530 --> 14:08.330
<b>Huh?</b>

14:09.010 --> 14:10.370
<b>Hurry up!</b>

14:10.640 --> 14:12.040
<b>A-All right...</b>

14:13.920 --> 14:17.140
<b>Hmm... It's not all that great, is it?</b>

14:18.870 --> 14:19.600
<b>Huh?</b>

14:20.580 --> 14:23.630
<b><i>When I sent it to Hinami later,</i></b>

14:23.630 --> 14:27.930
<b><i>she finally gave me the barest minimum 
of praise: "Well, it's in focus."</i></b>

14:28.880 --> 14:31.140
<b>Tomozaki</b>

14:35.360 --> 14:38.640
<b><i>The manuscript Kikuchi had given me</i></b>

14:38.640 --> 14:42.560
<b><i>was a collection of five short stories, 
loosely connected by shared themes.</i></b>

14:38.640 --> 14:48.150
<b>0.8-Carat Pain
Lugor and the Giant Stone
The Moon's Not Reflected in His Eyes
Clockwork Birthday</b>

14:43.250 --> 14:48.150
<b><i>Every one of the stories she 
wrote was gentle and warm.</i></b>

14:50.230 --> 14:51.200
<b>Huh?</b>

14:51.910 --> 14:56.160
<b>My Unfamiliar Way to Fly</b>

14:52.380 --> 14:55.080
<b>Is that where it ends?</b>

14:59.640 --> 15:03.960
<b>I never thought the father 
would show up at the end!</b>

15:03.960 --> 15:05.360
<b>Oh, that!</b>

15:05.360 --> 15:07.920
<b>It came to me after I was done—
I changed it.</b>

15:08.180 --> 15:12.050
<b>I figured it would be a 
weight off Wolfin's mind.</b>

15:12.470 --> 15:13.690
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:13.690 --> 15:17.740
<b>Oh, and I liked how the beast-person 
Lugor didn't break the rock—</b>

15:17.740 --> 15:20.400
<b>Mita the human did!</b>

15:20.400 --> 15:22.380
<b>Like he was using brains, not brawn,</b>

15:22.380 --> 15:24.440
<b>to pierce the wall between their species.</b>

15:24.700 --> 15:28.570
<b>I'm so happy you understood all of that...</b>

15:28.570 --> 15:34.570
<b>Oh, actually, that last story cut 
off halfway through. Was that—</b>

15:34.570 --> 15:37.950
<b>Huh? You mean... the dragon story?</b>

15:37.950 --> 15:39.540
<b>Yeah, the dragon story.</b>

15:44.540 --> 15:47.050
<b>My mistake! I-I'm so sorry!</b>

15:47.490 --> 15:49.300
<b>Mistake?</b>

15:49.300 --> 15:51.800
<b>That one's not finished yet.</b>

15:52.210 --> 15:54.930
<b>I write everything in the 
same file, you see, so...</b>

15:55.680 --> 16:00.060
<b>It must have gotten printed 
along with the rest.</b>

16:00.360 --> 16:02.380
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

16:02.790 --> 16:06.650
<b>That one made the biggest 
impression on me, though—</b>

16:03.060 --> 16:06.650
<b>My Unfamiliar Way to Fly</b>

16:06.910 --> 16:09.400
<b>a tale of raising the last dragon.</b>

16:10.740 --> 16:17.020
<b>It's as if the characters really came 
alive in my head while I was reading it.</b>

16:17.020 --> 16:22.870
<b>You know... it's like what you 
said before, about Andi's books.</b>

16:23.230 --> 16:25.090
<b>What <i>I</i> said?</b>

16:25.090 --> 16:25.890
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

16:25.890 --> 16:29.520
<b>That when you're reading, the book's 
world blinks right into your head as is.</b>

16:29.520 --> 16:32.160
<b>When I was reading that story,</b>

16:32.160 --> 16:37.050
<b>the world it described hit 
me as so real, so colorful.</b>

16:39.050 --> 16:41.140
<b>That last story in particular</b>

16:41.540 --> 16:44.640
<b>made me feel like I do when 
I read Andi's novels...</b>

16:45.140 --> 16:46.570
<b>Or something like that.</b>

16:47.650 --> 16:49.420
<b>K-Kikuchi?!</b>

16:50.320 --> 16:53.650
<b>Oh, um, I... I'm sorry.</b>

16:53.650 --> 16:55.990
<b>Wh-What's wrong?</b>

16:57.370 --> 17:00.490
<b>I've loved Andi's work all this time,</b>

17:00.980 --> 17:06.240
<b>and I've always wanted to 
write something similar.</b>

17:06.240 --> 17:08.080
<b>Really... always.</b>

17:08.720 --> 17:12.010
<b>I know I'm still just starting out and all,</b>

17:12.010 --> 17:16.760
<b>but to hear that from you, 
after you read my work...</b>

17:17.230 --> 17:19.020
<b>It just makes me so happy.</b>

17:20.060 --> 17:21.080
<b>I see...</b>

17:23.300 --> 17:24.810
<b>Hey, Kikuchi?</b>

17:24.810 --> 17:25.770
<b>Yes?</b>

17:26.050 --> 17:32.280
<b>Why don't you use this last 
story to write our class play?</b>

17:33.520 --> 17:39.530
<b>I'd love to see the whole class 
performing something you wrote.</b>

17:40.090 --> 17:42.160
<b>But I...</b>

17:42.160 --> 17:45.870
<b>Sorry! You don't have to.</b>

17:46.300 --> 17:47.750
<b>I'm scared.</b>

17:49.460 --> 17:51.620
<b>That last story...</b>

17:51.620 --> 17:54.790
<b>It was coming along so 
smoothly when I started,</b>

17:54.790 --> 17:59.970
<b>and I came to love each and 
every one of its characters.</b>

18:00.240 --> 18:04.970
<b>It became one of my favorite stories.
 It means the world to me.</b>

18:05.430 --> 18:09.890
<b>But that's why I'm having 
such a hard time deciding</b>

18:09.890 --> 18:14.610
<b>what conclusion this beloved story,
 these dear characters,</b>

18:14.610 --> 18:16.080
<b>should reach in the end.</b>

18:16.670 --> 18:20.120
<b>And that's why I couldn't write an ending.</b>

18:20.120 --> 18:22.240
<b>Oh... is that why...</b>

18:22.770 --> 18:26.120
<b>It's all so precious, I'm afraid it'll break.</b>

18:26.470 --> 18:30.630
<b>I see. Then this story might be 
better off staying inside you,</b>

18:30.630 --> 18:33.480
<b>where it can be nurtured carefully over time.</b>

18:34.080 --> 18:39.130
<b>Or that's what I <i>would</i> have said,
 not too long ago.</b>

18:39.440 --> 18:42.010
<b>Huh? Then...</b>

18:47.360 --> 18:48.270
<b>Okay!</b>

18:48.840 --> 18:50.770
<b>How's the play coming along?</b>

18:51.120 --> 18:53.270
<b>Any original stories we can use?</b>

18:54.120 --> 18:55.470
<b>If I could?</b>

18:56.030 --> 19:02.780
<b>My Unfamiliar Way to Fly</b>

18:56.750 --> 18:59.550
<b>I'm wondering if we could use this as a base,</b>

18:59.550 --> 19:02.780
<b>discussing it together, choosing roles,
 and tweaking as we go.</b>

19:03.600 --> 19:08.710
<b>Hmm. Can't say I really get it, 
but it has, like, actual sentences.</b>

19:09.010 --> 19:10.530
<b>It's a fantasy story.</b>

19:10.530 --> 19:12.210
<b>Could be fun!</b>

19:12.520 --> 19:15.210
<b>That's our Brain! Taking care of business!</b>

19:15.520 --> 19:17.420
<b>Hey, Fumiya...</b>

19:17.740 --> 19:19.130
<b>did you write this?</b>

19:19.130 --> 19:21.130
<b>Army Boy? Seriously?</b>

19:21.380 --> 19:23.640
<b>No, Kikuchi did.</b>

19:24.900 --> 19:27.290
<b>Huh! I see how it is.</b>

19:27.290 --> 19:29.700
<b>Wh-What's <i>that</i> supposed to mean?</b>

19:33.260 --> 19:37.280
<b>I-I'm still working on the second half.</b>

19:37.580 --> 19:39.930
<b>Thanks for your patience!</b>

19:43.620 --> 19:47.490
<b>I've always been afraid 
to leave my own world.</b>

19:48.170 --> 19:52.870
<b>But with all our conversations recently...</b>

19:53.470 --> 19:59.630
<b>I'm watching you go before me, 
leaping from a lonely world</b>

19:59.630 --> 20:01.130
<b>to one that's still unknown.</b>

20:01.130 --> 20:02.380
<b>And it occurred to me:</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:04.910
<b>I'd like to see that world, too.</b>

20:05.390 --> 20:09.390
<b>Our Original Play
"My Unfamiliar Way to Fly"</b>

20:13.900 --> 20:15.650
<b>Then we're all set!</b>

20:15.650 --> 20:20.150
<b>Kikuchi, could you write up a quick 
synopsis before our next meeting?</b>

20:20.750 --> 20:23.360
<b>Y-Yes, that should be fine.</b>

20:23.360 --> 20:27.610
<b>Okay. Then we can start 
assigning roles, right?</b>

20:27.610 --> 20:29.040
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:29.040 --> 20:31.750
<b>All right! I'll take the lead!</b>

20:31.750 --> 20:32.870
<b>Takei!</b>

20:33.800 --> 20:35.420
<b>Literally <i>anyone</i> but you.</b>

20:48.480 --> 20:51.600
<b><i>Things were looking good 
for the culture festival.</i></b>

20:52.080 --> 20:55.350
<b><i>Now to tackle Hinami's tasks—</i></b>

20:53.350 --> 20:55.350
<b>Takahiro Mizusawa in glasses</b>

20:55.350 --> 20:56.600
<b>Something on your mind?</b>

20:56.890 --> 20:58.110
<b>Whoa!</b>

20:58.110 --> 20:59.230
<b>M-Mizusawa?!</b>

20:59.760 --> 21:03.900
<b>Man, you really are more 
than you seem, Fumiya.</b>

21:04.200 --> 21:06.700
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

21:07.030 --> 21:11.260
<b>Hmm... You don't need to know.</b>

21:11.700 --> 21:15.120
<b>Takahiro Mizusawa in glasses</b>

21:12.070 --> 21:15.120
<b><i>"Mizusawa in glasses," eh?</i></b>

21:15.390 --> 21:19.470
<b>H-Hey, Mizusawa. Are you free 
tomorrow or the day after?</b>

21:19.470 --> 21:22.420
<b>What's this about? Rare for you to ask.</b>

21:22.420 --> 21:26.010
<b>I-I guess so. I'd like to get out somewhere.</b>

21:26.400 --> 21:31.010
<b>Hmm... Does that mean <i>you're</i> free tomorrow?</b>

21:31.980 --> 21:32.890
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:33.150 --> 21:35.770
<b>Perfect. We'll go to a culture festival.</b>

21:36.010 --> 21:37.480
<b>A culture festival?</b>

21:39.860 --> 21:41.950
<b>At Gumi's high school.</b>

21:42.990 --> 21:45.260
<b>It's invitation-only,</b>

21:46.100 --> 21:48.680
<b>but I managed to score two tickets.</b>

21:48.680 --> 21:51.740
<b>We can scope out another school's 
festival while we're at it.</b>

21:52.000 --> 21:54.700
<b>Oh, okay. Sure thing.</b>

21:54.940 --> 21:58.670
<b>Incidentally, Gumi goes 
to an all-girls school.</b>

21:58.880 --> 22:01.500
<b>Huh? All... girls?</b>

22:01.760 --> 22:03.500
<b>Yep: all girls!</b>

22:04.450 --> 22:06.450
<b>All... girls...</b>
